<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Dec jobless rises to 12.84 pct (12.17).</title>
<headline>Slovak Dec jobless rises to 12.84 pct (12.17).</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of jobless in Slovakia in December totalled 329,749, or 12.84 percent of the workforce, up from 12.17 percent in November, the National Labour Office said on Friday.  </p>
<p> SLOVAK UNEMPLOYMENT	 DEC 1996    NOV 1996    DEC 1995</p>
<p>  Total jobless		329,749     312,452     333,291</p>
<p>  Percentage of workforce   12.84	 12.17	 13.10</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
